              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Petro wakavuwa, wamwaambila wati, Langa! iswe tulisiide zintu zyoonse kuzootobela nduwe. Ino tuyoopegwanzi? ",
          "type": "text",
